"sur les <span class=\"mono\">%(total)s</span> présents sont de l'audio brut de "
"narration de livres terminés, ou qui n'ont connu qu'un aperçu."

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/storage.html:43
msgid ""
"The working files here all belong to books that stopped part-way. They are what lets "
"those books carry on; tick one below only if you would rather narrate it again from "
"the start."
