#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/storage.html:78
msgid "The app itself — its engine and models"
msgstr "L'application elle-même — son moteur et ses modèles"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/storage.html:82
msgid "Other — temporary files, the window's browser profile"
msgstr "Autre — fichiers temporaires, profil de navigateur de la fenêtre"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/storage.html:91
msgid "Book by book"
msgstr "Livre par livre"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/storage.html:111
msgid "safe"
msgstr "sans risque"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/storage.html:113
msgid "in use"
msgstr "utilisé"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/storage.html:123
msgid "What these files are"
msgstr "Ce que sont ces fichiers"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/storage.html:126
msgid "Raw audio, one piece at a time"
msgstr "De l'audio brut, un morceau à la fois"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/storage.html:127
msgid ""
"Every sentence is narrated separately and saved uncompressed, then stitched into "
"chapters and packed into the <code>.m4b</code>. The raw pieces stay behind "
"afterwards."
msgstr ""
"Chaque phrase est narrée séparément et enregistrée sans compression, puis assemblée "
"en chapitres et empaquetée dans le <code>.m4b</code>. Les morceaux bruts restent "
"ensuite sur le disque."

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/storage.html:130
msgid "All they buy you is a shortcut"
msgstr "Ils ne servent qu'à gagner du temps"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/storage.html:131
msgid ""
"While they exist, changing a voice setting re-narrates only the parts that changed — "
"minutes instead of hours. Once you are happy with a book, that shortcut is worth "
"nothing."
msgstr ""
"Tant qu'ils existent, changer un réglage de voix ne renarre que les parties "
"concernées — des minutes au lieu d'heures. Une fois satisfait d'un livre, ce "
"raccourci ne vaut plus rien."

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/storage.html:134
msgid "You keep everything that matters"
msgstr "Vous gardez tout ce qui compte"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/storage.html:135
msgid ""
"The finished audiobook, your ebook, your voices, your section choices — untouched. "
"You can always narrate the book again from scratch."
msgstr ""
"Le livre audio terminé, votre livre, vos voix, vos choix de sections — intacts. Vous "
"pourrez toujours narrer le livre à nouveau depuis le début."

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/storage.html:145
msgid "Free them the moment a book finishes"
msgstr "Les libérer dès qu'un livre est terminé"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/storage.html:146
msgid "On — a finished book now cleans up after itself."
msgstr "Activé — un livre terminé fait désormais le ménage derrière lui."

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/storage.html:147
msgid ""
"Off, so nothing is ever deleted without you. Turn it on and every finished book "
"cleans up after itself."
msgstr ""
"Désactivé, donc rien n'est jamais supprimé sans vous. Activez-le et chaque livre "
"terminé fait le ménage derrière lui."

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/storage.html:168
msgid "Left switched off."
msgstr "Laissé désactivé."

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/storage.html:179
#, python-format
msgid "%(n)s selected · %(size)s"
msgstr "%(n)s sélectionnés · %(size)s"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/storage.html:180
msgid "nothing selected"
msgstr "rien de sélectionné"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/storage.html:185
msgid "Nothing selected"
msgstr "Rien de sélectionné"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/storage.html:200
#, python-format
msgid "Free up %(size)s?"
msgstr "Libérer %(size)s ?"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/storage.html:202
msgid "Delete anyway"
msgstr "Supprimer quand même"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/storage.html:203
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Deletes the raw narration audio for %(n)s book. Finished audiobooks, your ebooks and "
"your voices are untouched."
msgid_plural ""
"Deletes the raw narration audio for %(n)s books. Finished audiobooks, your ebooks and"
" your voices are untouched."
msgstr[0] ""
"Supprime l'audio brut de narration de %(n)s livre. Les livres audio terminés, vos "
"livres et vos voix sont intacts."
msgstr[1] ""
"Supprime l'audio brut de narration de %(n)s livres. Les livres audio terminés, vos "
"livres et vos voix sont intacts."

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/storage.html:207
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(n)s of these stopped part-way through. Its working files are what let it carry on —"
" delete them and those sections are narrated again from the beginning."
msgid_plural ""
"%(n)s of these stopped part-way through. Their working files are what let them carry "
"on — delete them and those sections are narrated again from the beginning."
msgstr[0] ""
"%(n)s d'entre eux s'est arrêté en cours de route. Ses fichiers de travail sont ce qui"
" lui permet de reprendre — supprimez-les et ces sections seront narrées à nouveau "
"depuis le début."
msgstr[1] ""
"%(n)s d'entre eux se sont arrêtés en cours de route. Leurs fichiers de travail sont "
"ce qui leur permet de reprendre — supprimez-les et ces sections seront narrées à "
"nouveau depuis le début."

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/storage.html:223
#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/storage.html:225
#, python-format
msgid "Freed %(size)s — %(n)s book was left alone because it is in use"
msgid_plural "Freed %(size)s — %(n)s books were left alone because they are in use"
msgstr[0] "%(size)s libérés — %(n)s livre a été laissé tel quel car il est utilisé"
msgstr[1] "%(size)s libérés — %(n)s livres ont été laissés tels quels car ils sont utilisés"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/voices.html:10
msgid ""
"A voice is one short recording. About ten seconds is enough — the engine copies its "
"timbre and reads your whole book in it."
msgstr ""
"Une voix, c'est un court enregistrement. Une dizaine de secondes suffit — le moteur "
"en copie le timbre et lit tout votre livre avec."

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/voices.html:17
msgid "Which language's narrators to show"
msgstr "Quelles voix afficher, par langue"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/voices.html:24
#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/voices.html:47
msgid "Add a voice"
msgstr "Ajouter une voix"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/voices.html:36
msgid ""
"These narrators can't be auditioned yet: the model for this language isn't on this "
"computer."
msgstr ""
"Ces voix ne peuvent pas encore être écoutées : le modèle de cette langue n'est pas "
"sur cet ordinateur."

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/voices.html:37
msgid "Install it in Settings"
msgstr "L'installer dans les Réglages"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/voices.html:43
msgid ""
"<b>Use only voices you have the right to use.</b> Your own recording, or one whose "
"owner has agreed to this. Clips never leave this computer — but that is not the same "
"thing as permission."
msgstr ""
"<b>N'utilisez que des voix que vous avez le droit d'utiliser.</b> Votre propre "
"enregistrement, ou celui d'une personne qui a donné son accord. Les extraits ne "
"quittent jamais cet ordinateur — mais ce n'est pas la même chose qu'une permission."

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/voices.html:51
msgid "Name it"
msgstr "Nommez-la"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/voices.html:52
msgid "Warm baritone"
msgstr "Baryton chaleureux"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/voices.html:55
msgid "Language it speaks"
msgstr "Langue parlée"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/voices.html:63
msgid "Reference clip"
msgstr "Extrait de référence"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/voices.html:71
msgid ""
"WAV, MP3, FLAC, M4A, MP4, OGG, Opus, AAC or WebM — converted to WAV on the way in. "
"Ten seconds of clear, unaccompanied speech works best."
msgstr ""
"WAV, MP3, FLAC, M4A, MP4, OGG, Opus, AAC ou WebM — converti en WAV à l'entrée. Dix "
"secondes de parole claire, sans musique, donnent les meilleurs résultats."

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/voices.html:72
msgid ""
"The language decides which books can be read in this voice, and which sentence the "
"audition reads back. It is not guessed from the recording."
msgstr ""
"La langue détermine quels livres peuvent être lus par cette voix, et quelle phrase "
"l'écoute restitue. Elle n'est pas devinée à partir de l'enregistrement."

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/voices.html:74
msgid "Add this voice"
msgstr "Ajouter cette voix"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/voices.html:86
msgid "shipped"
msgstr "fournie"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/voices.html:86
msgid "engine default"
msgstr "voix par défaut du moteur"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/voices.html:87
msgid "new books start here"
msgstr "les nouveaux livres commencent ici"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/voices.html:90
msgid "ships with the app · public domain"
msgstr "fournie avec l'application · domaine public"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/voices.html:91
msgid "the engine’s own voice — no clip"
msgstr "la voix propre du moteur — pas d'extrait"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/voices.html:109
msgid "Needs this language's model — install it in Settings."
msgstr "Demande le modèle de cette langue — installez-le dans les Réglages."

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/voices.html:110
msgid "Audition"
msgstr "Écouter"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/voices.html:112
msgid "Use this voice for books you add from now on"
msgstr "Utiliser cette voix pour les livres ajoutés à partir de maintenant"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/voices.html:113
msgid "Use for new books"
msgstr "Pour les nouveaux livres"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/voices.html:118
#, python-format
msgid "Delete “%(name)s”?"
msgstr "Supprimer « %(name)s » ?"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/voices.html:119
msgid "Books already narrated with it are unaffected."
msgstr "Les livres déjà narrés avec elle ne sont pas affectés."

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/voices.html:164
msgid "Rendering…"
msgstr "Génération…"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/voices.html:172
#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/voices.html:192
msgid "Couldn't render a sample"
msgstr "Impossible de générer un échantillon"

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/voices.html:183
msgid "Still waiting — a render is ahead of it. Try again once that finishes."
msgstr "Toujours en attente — une narration passe avant. Réessayez quand elle sera terminée."

#: ebook_audiobook/web/templates/voices.html:191
msgid "Sample ready — press play to hear it"
msgstr "Échantillon prêt — appuyez sur lecture pour l'écouter"

